ck>` element with `[kind=\"captions\"]`\nMon, 11 Oct 2021 20:59:41 GMT status Evaluating: Buttons have an accessible name\nMon, 11 Oct 2021 20:59:41 GMT status Evaluating: The page contains a heading, skip link, or landmark region\nMon, 11 Oct 2021 20:59:41 GMT status Evaluating: Background and foreground colors have a sufficient contrast ratio\nMon, 11 Oct 2021 20:59:41 GMT status Evaluating: `<dl>`'s contain only properly-ordered `<dt>` and `<dd>` groups, `<script>` or `<template>` elements.\nMon, 11 Oct 2021 20:59:41 GMT status Evaluating: Definition list items are wrapped in `<dl>` elements\nMon, 11 Oct 2021 20:59:41 GMT status Evaluating: Document has a `<title>` element\nMon, 11 Oct 2021 20:59:41 GMT status Evaluating: `[id]` attributes on the page are unique\nMon, 11 Oct 2021 20:59:41 GMT status Evaluating: `<frame>` or `<iframe>` elements have a title\nMon, 11 Oct 2021 20:59:41 GMT status Evaluating: `<html>` element has a `[lang]` attribute\nMon, 11 Oct 2021 20:59:41 GMT status Evaluating: `<html>` element has a valid value for its `[lang]` attribute\nMon, 11 Oct 2021 20:59:41 GMT status Evaluating: Image elements have `[alt]` attributes\nMon, 11 Oct 2021 20:59:41 GMT status Evaluating: `<input type=\"image\">` elements have `[alt]` text\nMon, 11 Oct 2021 20:59:41 GMT status Evaluating: Form elements have associated labels\nMon, 11 Oct 2021 20:59:41 GMT status Evaluating: Presentational `<table>` elements avoid using `<th>`, `<caption>` or the `[summary]` attribute.\nMon, 11 Oct 2021 20:59:41 GMT status Evaluating: Links have a discernible name\nMon, 11 Oct 2021 20:59:41 GMT status Evaluating: Lists contain only `<li>` elements and script supporting elements (`<script>` and `<template>`).\nMon, 11 Oct 2021 20:59:41 GMT status Evaluating: List items (`<li>`) are contained within `<ul>` or `<ol>` parent elements\nMon, 11 Oct 2021 20:59:41 GMT status Evaluating: The document does not use `<meta http-equiv=\"refresh\">`\nMon, 11 Oct 2021 20:59:41 GMT status Eva